DOCUMENT();
loadMacros('PGstandard.pl', 'MathObjects.pl', 'PGcourse.pl');
TEXT(beginproblem());
$showPartialCorrectAnswers = 0;
$prompt = <<'PROMPT_F922_3FD6';
<p>f922_3fd6</p> <h4>Three-Point Test Cross Problem</h4><p>A test cross is a way to explore the relationship between genes and their respective alleles. It is a useful tool for genetic mapping and deciphering the inheritance of traits. Specifically, a three-point test cross examines three (3) genes at the same time to learn about their assortment in gamete formation.</p><p>A standard three-point test cross involves crossing a heterozygous organism for all three genes with an organism that is homozygous recessive for all three genes</p> <p>For this problem, a test cross using a fruit fly (<i>Drosophila melanogaster</i>) heterozygous for three genes was conducted to understand their genetic interactions.</p><h6>Characteristics of Recessive Phenotypes</h6><p><ul><li><strong><span style="color: #845011;">Gene D</span></strong> is linked with the '<span style="color: #845011;"><i>dewy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #845011;">Gene D</span> appears moist, with its body covered in tiny droplets of water.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #286d3f;">Gene W</span></strong> is correlated with the '<span style="color: #286d3f;"><i>waxy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #286d3f;">Gene W</span> has a thick protective layer that is water resistant and opague.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #1d5bb5;">Gene Y</span></strong> is affiliated with the '<span style="color: #1d5bb5;"><i>yucky</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #1d5bb5;">Gene Y</span> gives off an unpleasant odor and has a generally unappealing look.</li> </ul></p><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border: 2px solid black;"><tr><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Phenotype</span></th><th colspan="3" align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Genotypes</span></th><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Progeny<br/>Count</span></th></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">dewy, waxy, yucky</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe5cf; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">d</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d4f4d6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">w</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e2eaff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">y</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">6,811</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">dewy, waxy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe5cf; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">d</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d4f4d6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">w</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #1d5bb5;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">22,016</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">dewy, yucky</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe5cf; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">d</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #286d3f;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e2eaff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">y</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">66,673</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">dewy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe5cf; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">d</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #286d3f;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #1d5bb5;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">29,280</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">waxy, yucky</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #845011;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d4f4d6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">w</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e2eaff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">y</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">29,233</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">waxy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #845011;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d4f4d6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">w</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #1d5bb5;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">66,889</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">yucky</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #845011;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #286d3f;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e2eaff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">y</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">22,222</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;"><i>wildtype</i></span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #845011;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #286d3f;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #1d5bb5;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">6,876</span></td></tr><tr><th colspan="4" align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">TOTAL =</span></th><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">250,000</span></td></tr></table><p>The resulting phenotypes are summarized in the table above.</p> <h6>Question</h6> <p>With the progeny data from the table, and using only the genotypes that result from crossover events between the two genes <b>D</b> and <b>W</b> during meiosis.</p> <p><strong>calculate the genetic distance between the two genes <b>D</b> and <b>W</b>,</strong> expressing your answer in centimorgans (cM)</p>
PROMPT_F922_3FD6
loadMacros('parserRadioButtons.pl');
$choice_1 = <<'LITERAL_F922_3FD6_CHOICE_1';
<sup>(6,811 + 6,876 + 22,016 + 22,222)</sup>/<sub>250,000</sub> = <sup>57,925</sup>/<sub>250,000</sub> = 0.2317 = <strong>23.17 cM</strong>
LITERAL_F922_3FD6_CHOICE_1
$choice_2 = <<'LITERAL_F922_3FD6_CHOICE_2';
<sup>(6,811 + 6,876 + 22,016 + 29,233)</sup>/<sub>250,000</sub> = <sup>64,936</sup>/<sub>250,000</sub> = 0.2597 = <strong>25.97 cM</strong>
LITERAL_F922_3FD6_CHOICE_2
$choice_3 = <<'LITERAL_F922_3FD6_CHOICE_3';
<sup>(6,811 + 6,876 + 22,016 + 66,673)</sup>/<sub>250,000</sub> = <sup>102,376</sup>/<sub>250,000</sub> = 0.4095 = <strong>40.95 cM</strong>
LITERAL_F922_3FD6_CHOICE_3
$choice_4 = <<'LITERAL_F922_3FD6_CHOICE_4';
<sup>(6,876 + 22,016 + 22,222 + 29,280)</sup>/<sub>250,000</sub> = <sup>80,394</sup>/<sub>250,000</sub> = 0.3216 = <strong>32.16 cM</strong>
LITERAL_F922_3FD6_CHOICE_4
$choice_5 = <<'LITERAL_F922_3FD6_CHOICE_5';
<sup>(6,876 + 22,222 + 29,280 + 66,889)</sup>/<sub>250,000</sub> = <sup>125,267</sup>/<sub>250,000</sub> = 0.5011 = <strong>50.11 cM</strong>
LITERAL_F922_3FD6_CHOICE_5
$choice_6 = <<'LITERAL_F922_3FD6_CHOICE_6';
<sup>(66,673 + 66,889)</sup>/<sub>250,000</sub> = <sup>133,562</sup>/<sub>250,000</sub> = 0.5342 = <strong>53.42 cM</strong>
LITERAL_F922_3FD6_CHOICE_6
$correct_1 = <<'LITERAL_F922_3FD6_CORRECT_1';
<sup>(6,811 + 6,876 + 22,016 + 22,222)</sup>/<sub>250,000</sub> = <sup>57,925</sup>/<sub>250,000</sub> = 0.2317 = <strong>23.17 cM</strong>
LITERAL_F922_3FD6_CORRECT_1
@choices = ($choice_1, $choice_2, $choice_3, $choice_4, $choice_5, $choice_6);
$answer = RadioButtons([@choices], $correct_1, labels => 'ABC', displayLabels => 1, randomize => 0, noindex => 1, separator => '<div style="margin-bottom: 0.7em;"></div>');
TEXT(MODES(HTML => $prompt, TeX => ''));
BEGIN_TEXT
\{$answer->buttons\}
END_TEXT
ANS($answer->cmp);

ENDDOCUMENT();
